#: includes/admin/trait-plugin-rules.php:109
msgid "Saving only happens when no tested page breaks. If a visit with plugins left out ever ends in a fatal error, every rule switches itself off. Deactivating WPOptimizing, or define( 'WPOPT_DISABLE', true ) in wp-config.php, undoes everything at once."
